{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：Y对音乐本身的细节描写明显少于X，声部、音区、力度、旋律起伏等具体变化被压缩了，感受的层次也略有损失。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y把人物每一步的心理动机、顾虑和选择交代得更清楚，观众不需要读过原文，也能理解他为什么时而靠近、时而退缩，前后情绪转变有连续的因果关系。X的关键词突出，更方便快速扫视，而且音乐感受描写更丰富、更具体，但短词和意象堆叠较多，有时会让观众忙于接收感受，反而不容易抓住人物主线。总体而言，Y更适合普通观众边听边理解故事，X则在音乐感受的细腻度上有明显优势。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "fa123bbf-6290-4ba4-9453-10a4d63ffb59", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261106T231802538102Z", "elapsed_seconds": 44.031, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T23:18:46.584126+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "440f7206f921b3cc71c6e229e65fb57bde9d5004070b14f7cbd915ed4dcfeff9", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_atta